<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="48" color="#bcd8e6"><i>{\an2}镜头拉开——他独自坐在洗手间隔间里，屏幕里阳光灿烂，脸上却没有笑。</i></font>

4
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,500
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="48" color="#bcd8e6"><i>{\an2}每一个<font color="#f0c890">真实的{&HE6D8BC&}瞬间，都被剪成了一张<font color="#f0c890">完美{&HE6D8BC&}的照片。</font></font></i></font>

5
