<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="52">{\an2}林一：可我考试会失误，也会嫉妒别人。</font>

11
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,600
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="52">{\an2}一林：那你就更应该努力。你忘了别人有多<font color="#f0c890">喜欢{&HFFFFFF&}我们吗？</font></font>

12
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:49,100
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="48" color="#bcd8e6"><i>{\an2}四周浮现透明的镜面，每一面都映出一个更<font color="#f0c890">完美{&HE6D8BC&}的他。</font></i></font>

13
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:53,100
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="52">{\an2}镜面声：你应该更<font color="#f0c890">优秀{&HFFFFFF&}。／你不能落后。／别让大家失望。</font></font>

14
