<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="52">{\an2}林一：如果我做不到呢？</font>

15
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:02,100
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="48" color="#bcd8e6"><i>{\an2}一林第一次，沉默了。</i></font>

16
