31
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:12,100
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="48" color="#bcd8e6"><i>{\an2}一林（画外）：原来，我们不必一直<font color="#f0c890">满分{&HE6D8BC&}。</font></i></font>

